              rate.
            </blockquote>
            <figcaption>Seer Interactive, June 2025</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <p class="source__p r" style="--d:.26s">
            We build pages with definition-first openings, structured entity
            signals, citable statistics and Schema.org markup LLMs can parse.
            Accessibility is now a legal requirement, not a nice-to-have. The
            European Accessibility Act took effect June 28, 2025, with
            penalties reaching &euro;100,000 per violation in some member
            states.
          </p>
          <ul class="creds r" style="--d:.3s">
