          <p class="source__p source__p--quiet r" style="--d:.34s">
            <strong>Stack.</strong> Figma, Webflow, Framer, Shopify, headless
            on Next.js and Sanity. AI exploration on v0, Lovable, Cursor and
            our own brand-trained models. LLMrefs for AI-search tracking. We
            are not religious about any of it.
