                cycles old.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="vs__row vs__row--new r">
            <div class="vs__side">
              <span class="vs__tag vs__tag--new">Our workflow</span>
              <span class="vs__total vs__total--new">Two weeks</span>
            </div>
            <div class="vs__main">
              <div class="vs__bar vs__bar--new">
                <span class="vs__seg vs__seg--solo" style="--span:1;--i:0">
                  <span class="vs__seg-label">Brief to launch</span>
                  <span class="vs__seg-dur">Two weeks</span>
                </span>
                <span class="vs__rest" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </div>
              <p class="vs__p">
                Our workflow: ten layout directions in parallel as working
                prototypes, not static mockups. Core Web Vitals scored,
                accessibility audited, GEO baselined and SEO migration mapped
                before a single line of production code. Traffic split on day
